# Default: let git normalise line endings for source and docs.
* text=auto

# ⚠️ NOT the malformed fixtures. Their bytes ARE the test. crlf.csv exists to carry CRLF,
# cp1252.csv exists to be undecodable as UTF-8, binary.csv is a PNG header, and
# no_trailing_newline.csv is defined by what it does not end with. Line-ending
# normalisation on a Linux checkout would quietly turn each of them into a different file
# that still passes, which is worse than not having them.
fixtures/malformed/** -text -diff

# Generated from the tool's real output; diffing it line by line is noise.
docs/pii-scan.svg -diff
